      "handle": "eastmoor-cardigan-in-oatmeal-wool-2609",
      "body_html": "\u003cp\u003eThe Eastmoor Cardigan in Oatmeal Wool from Taylor Stitch\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e100% RWS wool.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5 gauge.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJersey construction.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle layer 2x2 rib at cuffs, neck and bottom opening.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDouble layer 1x1 rib at pocket opening.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHand wash cold and lay flat to dry or dry clean.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in China.\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e",
